.TH start-registry-info-set-default-locale 1  "set-default-locale "
.SH NAME
start\-registry\-info\-set\-default\-locale \- Set the locale the registry\*(Aqs own text falls back to
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-registry info set\-default\-locale\fR [\fB\-\-clear\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIDEFAULT_LOCALE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the locale the registry\*(Aqs own text falls back to
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-clear\fR
Remove the registry default locale
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIDEFAULT_LOCALE\fR]
Locale the registry\*(Aqs own text falls back to, such as en_US
